{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29563","headline":"过伊仆射旧宅 · 李商隐","name":"过伊仆射旧宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱邸方酬力战功，华筵俄叹逝波穷。\n回廊檐断燕飞去，小阁尘凝人语空。\n幽泪欲乾残菊露，余香犹入败荷风。\n何能更涉泷江去，独立寒流吊楚宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29563.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29563","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}